[
  {
    "content_id": "10063001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我這作長老的寫信給蒙揀選的女士和你的兒女，就是我本著真理所愛的。不但我愛你們，一切認識真理的人也都愛你們，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;這是因為真理在我們裡面，並且永遠與我們同在。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;父上帝和祂兒子耶穌基督的恩典、憐憫和平安，必在真理和愛中與我們同在！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我看見你一些兒女按照我們從父領受的命令遵行真理，感到非常欣慰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;女士啊，我現在勸你，我們要彼此相愛。這不是新命令，而是我們從起初就已經領受的命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;愛就是遵行上帝的命令。你們要活出愛，這是你們從起初就聽到的命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因為許多騙子已經來到世上，他們否認耶穌基督曾降世為人。這樣的人是騙子，是敵基督者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們要謹慎，好得到完滿的賞賜，免得我們前功盡棄。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;凡偏離基督教導的人，都沒有上帝；凡遵守基督教導的人，都有父和子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;若有人到你們那裡不傳基督的教導，不要請他到家裡，也不要問候他，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因為問候他就是與他同流合污。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我還有許多事要告訴你們，但不想藉助紙墨，只希望到你們那裡當面暢談，使我們喜樂滿溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10063001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰二書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "63001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你那蒙揀選之姊妹的兒女問候你。</p>"
  }
]